# ============================================================================
# What Docker must NEVER copy into an image (steps 44–46). The build context
# is the repo root, so everything here is excluded from every image.
# Secrets come from the VPS's /opt/nowoll/.env at RUN time, never at build time.
# ============================================================================

# ── Secrets and keys (CLAUDE.md Rule 3) ──────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
**/secrets/
**/*.secret*
id_rsa*
.npmrc

# ── Version control, editors, local tooling ─────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
.claude
*.log
.DS_Store

# ── Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image) ────────────────
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.next-e2e
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Not needed to run the API or workers ────────────────────────────────────
docs
infrastructure
# The shop and admin have their own image (web.Dockerfile, with its own ignore
# file); here only their package.json stays (the workspace needs it).
apps/storefront/**
!apps/storefront/package.json
apps/admin/**
!apps/admin/package.json
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
# The e2e package's files aren't needed — only its package.json, so the
# workspace (and pnpm-lock.yaml) stay complete for `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`.
tests/**
!tests/e2e/package.json
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
apps/api/test
workers/*/test
